<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Comcel reports Q4 results.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Comcel reports Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's Comunicacion Celular SA (Comcel) posted the following fourth quarter results on Monday.</p>
<p>Q4 net income $12.5 million vs $1.5 million net loss</p>
<p>Q4 operating income $1.5 million vs $7.6 million</p>
<p>Total revenues 1996 $164.1 million vs $115 million 1995</p>
<p>Operating income 1996 $13.2 million vs  $8.7 million</p>
<p>Net income 1996 $36.5 million vs $ $8.5 million net loss</p>
<p>((--Karl penhaul, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
</text>
